WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.450
Worth Using is an AI reviewer. It tells you whether what you built is useful to someone who isn't you.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.050
Right now, everyone loves it.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.200
Everyone, here, means you.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:20.050
Say your team built a bot that sums up every meeting. Week one, everyone reads it. Week four, nobody does.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.500
Worth Using asks six plain questions, from who it's for, to whether they come back.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:30.100
And every answer needs proof. Did you claim it, or did you see it?

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:35.350
So you watch someone use it. Feed it an empty meeting, and it sums that up too.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:37.050
Confidently.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:43.300
You cut the summary, and send each task to its owner. A month later, they're still opening it.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:48.450
Your team scores it alone, then compares. Your judgment sharpens too.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Worth Using. Build what people come back to.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:57.500
[on screen: Worth Using. Useful to someone who isn’t you. Get the skill: amplifier-skill-worth-using]

